TI  - Study on the Relationship Between 3D Landscape Patterns and Residents’ Comfort in Urban Multi-Unit High-Rise Residential Areas: A Case Study of High-Density Inland City
PY  - 2025
T2  - Sustainability (Switzerland)
VL  - 17
IS  - 10
C7  - 4347
