TI  - USING REMOTE SENSING TECHNOLOGIES FOR MONITORING URBAN HEAT ISLANDS
PY  - 2024
T2  - Visnyk of Taras Shevchenko National University of Kyiv. Geology
VL  - 3
IS  - 106
