TI  - Zoning Optimization Method of a Riverfront Greenspace Service Function Oriented to the Cooling Effect: A Case Study in Shanghai
PY  - 2022
T2  - International Journal of Environmental Research and Public Health
VL  - 19
IS  - 23
C7  - 16191
