TI  - Local variation of outdoor thermal comfort in different urban green spaces in Guangzhou, a subtropical city in South China
PY  - 2018
T2  - Urban Forestry and Urban Greening
VL  - 32
SP  - 99
EP  - 112
DO  - 10.1016/j.ufug.2018.04.005
